    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεωσ-τέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be in debt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Asp.
				<u>in EN</u>
				186.27
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεωστῶ τὴν ἐξέτασιν ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sever.
					<u>Clyst.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>have a claim to,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				7.8
			</span></i>; <i>have a debt owing to one,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.31
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be owed, owing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				4422.4
			</span></i>, Sch.D <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.685
			</span></i>.</div>
